{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47757","headline":"题南岳招仙观壁上 · 许碏","name":"题南岳招仙观壁上","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洪鑪烹锻人性命，器用不同分皆定。\n妖精鬼魅鬬神通，只自干邪不干正。\n黄口小儿初学行，唯知日月东西生。\n还爲万灵威圣力，移月在南日在北。\n玉爲玉兮石是石，蕴弃深泥终不易。\n邓通饿死严陵贫，帝王岂是无人力。\n丈夫未达莫相侵，攀龙附凤捐精神。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许碏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47757.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47757","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}